{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02968",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.4,
      "end_seconds": 4.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.34,
      "end_seconds": 10.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.25,
      "end_seconds": 15.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got restlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.56,
      "end_seconds": 19.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.08,
      "end_seconds": 24.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "It's been going on for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.72,
      "end_seconds": 28.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.61,
      "end_seconds": 34.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "A three out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.03,
      "end_seconds": 38.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.35,
      "end_seconds": 52.16,
      "duration_seconds": 12.81,
      "text": "Mm, it usually comes with impatience. The impatience? That's been for about three months. With impatience, I'd call it mild. I've been losing things too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.92,
      "end_seconds": 67.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.85,
      "end_seconds": 82.12,
      "duration_seconds": 13.27,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I swim twice a week. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.2,
      "end_seconds": 86.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.46,
      "end_seconds": 100.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for nearly five years. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.55,
      "end_seconds": 102.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.95,
      "end_seconds": 106.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I've got an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.01,
      "end_seconds": 115.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Alright, acid reflux and an underactive thyroid, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.73,
      "end_seconds": 132.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.02,
      "end_seconds": 143.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.57,
      "end_seconds": 147.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.05,
      "end_seconds": 156.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "Lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity. Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.02,
      "end_seconds": 165.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.83,
      "end_seconds": 175.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "No, um, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.28,
      "end_seconds": 180.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.38,
      "end_seconds": 184.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.44,
      "end_seconds": 187.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Any sign of head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.38,
      "end_seconds": 192.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Not at all, uh, no head injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.67,
      "end_seconds": 199.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Did you get thoughts of self-harm, drug use or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.75,
      "end_seconds": 203.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.19,
      "end_seconds": 207.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.07,
      "end_seconds": 210.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.83,
      "end_seconds": 215.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.75,
      "end_seconds": 217.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.33,
      "end_seconds": 220.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.89,
      "end_seconds": 231.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.09,
      "end_seconds": 252.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 128 over 81, temperature is 36.4 degrees, heart rate 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.49,
      "end_seconds": 259.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.39,
      "end_seconds": 262.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Alright, does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.26,
      "end_seconds": 285.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal and your examination is unremarkable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.03,
      "end_seconds": 300.82,
      "duration_seconds": 10.79,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably possible adult attention deficit disorder. Another possibility is anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.92,
      "end_seconds": 330.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for poor concentration. Use lists and reminders while we arrange the specialist assessment. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.46,
      "end_seconds": 333.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}